      "description": "The meme falsely equates the Sikh community (represented by the man in the turban) with Islam, using the turban as a visual symbol to reinforce the false association. This is a form of religious stereotyping that conflates Sikh identity with Muslim identity, which is a common tactic in Islamophobic rhetoric.",
