      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Barack Obama is mapped as 'islam's trojan horse'",
      "description": "The top text 'islam's trojan horse' is directly mapped onto the visual of Barack Obama, implying he is secretly aligned with Islam or is a Muslim. This is a hateful stereotype that equates Islam with terrorism or extremism, and uses Obama's image to promote this false association.",
